    "note": "Track ai-. Every number and both density curves come from collapse_evidence.py, which ships in this folder: 60 seeds, n=200 per generation, median over seeds. The reel claims tail loss under recursive generative training for a Gaussian-mixture world, which is what the script shows and one of the three families Shumailov et al. tested. It makes NO numeric claim about LLMs — the generation counts here are properties of this experiment. Outro is HaiTitleOutro. B04's curve is the measured per-generation median printed by collapse_evidence.py (generations 0,5,...,60), not an interpolation.",
