      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "SETUP",
      "narration_text": "Start with a world that has something rare in it. Most of the data sits in one ordinary lump around zero. Five percent of it sits all the way out here, far from everything else — a small subpopulation that genuinely exists and that you would want a model to know about. Generation zero draws two hundred samples from that world. Four and a half percent of them land in the rare part.",
