    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "LAND",
      "narration_text": "And here is the part that should bother you. This is the shape at generation forty, with the original dashed in behind it. The bump is simply gone. But look at the numbers underneath. The mean moved from plus zero point two eight to plus zero point three six. The standard deviation went from one point six to one point seven. Nothing in the ordinary summary statistics tells you that five percent of the world is permanently missing.",
